          {
           "type": "text",
           "id": "a34fb7d",
           "html": "Safety and regulatory compliance demand accurate calculations for metrics like vessel longitudinal strength and stability. Rely on LR SEASAFE to deliver this across design, operations and cargo planning for all types of vessels and offshore structures – from passenger ships, oil tankers and gas carriers to semi-submersibles and jack-up rigs."
          }
         ]
